==Phases==
A typical run consists of

* Spell Stacking phase
* Pet Levelling phase
* Void Mana Phase 
* Quick Burst Phase to get upgrades and sources.
* Void Mana Phase
* Burst Phase

===Spell Stacking===
{{Xbox|Due to a bug that still exists in the XBOX version of the game - [[Augment]] spells like {{SpellTooltip|Arcane Infusion}} (aka AI) do not take effect unless there is at least 1 manual cast of them each exile or game session. Be sure to remove {{SpellTooltip|Jas'Aham's Thunderous Swarm|JTS}} (so that AI will charge) and cast {{SpellTooltip|Arcane Infusion|AI}} once before resuming normal buildup. (If you ever burst and barely get profit, this is probably why!)}}

Stack Persistents, Accumulated, Augment.

If you're using mythic imbued items for extra stacking, this phase can be split into up to 3 smaller phases using each item - one for more Persistent Casts Gain, one for more Augment Casts Gain, and one for more Maximum Spell Charges (for accumulated stacking - Accumulated Casts Gain won't work with JTS).

JTS only charges from the shard pool 10 times per second, so we use {{SpellTooltip|Lightning Bolt}} to charge it at max cast rate.  Lightning bolt must grant at least 1e8 shards per cast to be worth using, so we use Archivist with evocation gear to make sure it's strong enough.

