* Archivist makes PAP^1 = Evo, so check whether {{ItemTooltip|Ceaseless Hunger}} is better.
* Do not enchant {{ItemTooltip|The Magnifier}}, {{ItemTooltip|The Rubedo Engine}}, or {{ItemTooltip|Temporal Scabbard}}.  {{ItemTooltip|Easymind Hat}} and {{ItemTooltip|Resonator Ring}} can be enchanted a bit to keep the shard pool full.
* Use {{ItemTooltip|Concealing Shroud}} instead of {{ItemTooltip|The Magnifier}} if that increases your {{SpellTooltip|Jas'Aham's Thunderous Swarm|JTS}} cast rate
* Once you're far enough, you won't need to run {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Conjure Lesser Elemental}}, so occasionally check if you still need it. If you don't, remove it so that {{SpellTooltip|Jas'Aham's Thunderous Swarm|JTS}} gives more casts to the rest of the spells.

