===Burst===
Get as much mana as possible.

For a significant boost, flick between your stacking set and your burst set (with about a 1-2 second delay) repeatedly to refill your stacks of {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Jas'Aham's Thunderous Swarm}} and bursting again and again with an exponential set of extra casts. Keep your pet on {{PetTooltip|pet_name = Risen Giant}}; just keep buying mana sources and upgrades as they become available. There might be a more optimal way to achieve this, but this is simple enough and it works thanks to {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Conjure Lesser Elemental}}'s extra shard capacity and probably some stacking items as well. 

When you reach 4 to 4.5 delusions (or whenever progression feels difficult), you can perform what is known as a "[[Catalysts#Configuration%20Swapping/Catalyst%20Respeccing|Catalyst Respec]]", which will increase your profits. This is particularly useful if you're struggling to reach the 5 delusion mark to unlock the enhanced spell.  

{{Note|Profits are at their highest inside the range of 4 to 10 minutes after selecting {{PetTooltip|pet_name = Risen Giant}}. After that, Void Mana degeneration brings it down much more than the pet keeps scaling it up.}}

