==Pantheon==
Order of priority of pantheons, with secondary abilities, is roughly:

Cerebros = Altermutus > Tempoaeverum > Chaos > Procreogenus > Ardourium > Animatealia 

Veritallios has nearly zero value.

Animatealia should be roughly half of Cerebros until higher levels, at which point Cerebros should be closer to about 4-5 levels ahead of Animatealia.

